      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Performance Remix: finish\n\nUpscales a stage 2 video with SeedVR2, applies a light grade and saves an H.264 MP4 with the original audio. It works through the video one segment at a time, so memory stays the same for a 5-second or a 30-second clip.\n\n1. **Video to finish**: a video from `output/performance-remix/motion_*.mp4`, copied into `input/`.\n2. **Streaming Finish** settings:\n   - **scale**: 2 turns 480x848 into 960x1696.\n   - **segment_frames**: frames processed at once; lower it if you run out of memory.\n   - **overlap**: frames shared by neighbouring segments and crossfaded.\n   - **color_correction**: lab keeps the colors of the input.\n   - **sharpen** and **contrast**: the light grade; set 0 and 1.0 for the plain upscale.\n   - **crf**: H.264 quality, 16 by default.\n3. Run. The MP4 is saved to `output/performance-remix/finish_*.mp4`.\n\nModel: `seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot` by default; `seedvr2_7b_sharp_int8_convrot` gives smoother lines. Files: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2 (Apache 2.0).\n\nMeasured on a 32 GB GPU: an 11-second clip (337 frames) in 444 s, 8.1 GB of process RAM, 14.3 GB of GPU memory."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Performance Remix: finish\n\nUpscales a stage 2 video with SeedVR2, applies a light grade and saves an H.264 MP4 with the original audio. It works through the video one segment at a time, so memory stays the same for a 5-second or a 30-second clip.\n\n1. **Video to finish**: a video from `output/performance-remix/motion_*.mp4`, copied into `input/`.\n2. **Streaming Finish** settings:\n   - **scale**: 2 turns 480x848 into 960x1696.\n   - **segment_frames**: frames processed at once; lower it if you run out of memory.\n   - **overlap**: frames shared by neighbouring segments and crossfaded.\n   - **color_correction**: lab keeps the colors of the input.\n   - **sharpen** and **contrast**: the light grade; set 0 and 1.0 for the plain upscale.\n   - **crf**: H.264 quality, 16 by default.\n3. Run. The MP4 is saved to `output/performance-remix/finish_*.mp4`.\n\nModel: `seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot` by default; `seedvr2_7b_sharp_int8_convrot` gives smoother lines. Files: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2 (Apache 2.0).\n\nMeasured on a 32 GB GPU: an 11-second clip (337 frames) in 444 s, 8.1 GB of process RAM, 14.3 GB of GPU memory."
      },
